# The built PWA is an artifact, except the placeholder that keeps Go
# builds working without Node. (The dir itself must be un-excluded
# first: a file cannot be re-included inside an excluded directory.)
!internal/web/dist/
internal/web/dist/*
!internal/web/dist/.gitkeep
